        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER WAYS TO MAKE MONEY !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in Brokeville doesn’t come cheap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade crypto, complete deliveries, join races, or find side hustles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every method has its risk  but sometimes risk is the only way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/054c0ce67a0a524c2de3cf01fbe2baa2.poster.avif?t=1784576582\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/054c0ce67a0a524c2de3cf01fbe2baa2.webm?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/054c0ce67a0a524c2de3cf01fbe2baa2.mp4?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOW YOUR STYLE !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your outfit, buy your dream vehicle, shape your vibe, and stand out in the chaos of Brokeville ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival’s important, but looking cool matters too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/c9ebc6cc51a023550d77ec9d00c848ed.poster.avif?t=1784576582\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/c9ebc6cc51a023550d77ec9d00c848ed.webm?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/c9ebc6cc51a023550d77ec9d00c848ed.mp4?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE ART OF VEHICLE TRADING !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br>Buy, repair, customize, and resell vehicles for profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart investments and sharp deals make all the difference in Brokeville.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/0e0cf30983bbac3fa8aabaa6f7b2b0a2.poster.avif?t=1784576582\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/0e0cf30983bbac3fa8aabaa6f7b2b0a2.webm?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/0e0cf30983bbac3fa8aabaa6f7b2b0a2.mp4?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD AND MANAGE YOUR OWN SHOP !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Brokeville, success starts with a dusty little shop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your business type, organize your shelves, keep things clean, and manage your staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything’s under your control  prices, customer flow, and occasionally... the trash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/a75ab6f0a99daa31bf78931b6d4de10e.poster.avif?t=1784576582\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/a75ab6f0a99daa31bf78931b6d4de10e.webm?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/a75ab6f0a99daa31bf78931b6d4de10e.mp4?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER WAYS TO MAKE MONEY !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in Brokeville doesn’t come cheap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade crypto, complete deliveries, join races, or find side hustles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every method has its risk  but sometimes risk is the only way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/054c0ce67a0a524c2de3cf01fbe2baa2.poster.avif?t=1784576582\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/054c0ce67a0a524c2de3cf01fbe2baa2.webm?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/054c0ce67a0a524c2de3cf01fbe2baa2.mp4?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOW YOUR STYLE !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your outfit, buy your dream vehicle, shape your vibe, and stand out in the chaos of Brokeville ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival’s important, but looking cool matters too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/c9ebc6cc51a023550d77ec9d00c848ed.poster.avif?t=1784576582\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/c9ebc6cc51a023550d77ec9d00c848ed.webm?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/c9ebc6cc51a023550d77ec9d00c848ed.mp4?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE ART OF VEHICLE TRADING !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br>Buy, repair, customize, and resell vehicles for profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart investments and sharp deals make all the difference in Brokeville.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/0e0cf30983bbac3fa8aabaa6f7b2b0a2.poster.avif?t=1784576582\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/0e0cf30983bbac3fa8aabaa6f7b2b0a2.webm?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/0e0cf30983bbac3fa8aabaa6f7b2b0a2.mp4?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD AND MANAGE YOUR OWN SHOP !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Brokeville, success starts with a dusty little shop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your business type, organize your shelves, keep things clean, and manage your staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything’s under your control  prices, customer flow, and occasionally... the trash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/a75ab6f0a99daa31bf78931b6d4de10e.poster.avif?t=1784576582\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/a75ab6f0a99daa31bf78931b6d4de10e.webm?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555430/extras/a75ab6f0a99daa31bf78931b6d4de10e.mp4?t=1784576582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
